        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the tournament training and one city's championship, then farm Champion's Seals.\n\n1. Use an eligible Alliance character. Visit Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament in Icecrown (69.6, 22.8), enable Trivial Quests, and accept The Argent Tournament. Follow the introduction to your faction pavilion.\n\n2. Complete the mounted-combat mastery lessons. For Up To The Challenge, do the Aspirant dailies until you have 15 Aspirant's Seals, then complete The Aspirant's Challenge. Equip the provided lance and ride a tournament mount; maintain three Defend stacks, break the opponent's shields, and Charge when there is room.\n\n3. Become a Valiant for the city offered to your race. Complete its daily training to collect 25 Valiant's Seals for The Valiant's Charge, then win The Valiant's Challenge and turn in A Champion Rises. These daily gates cannot be skipped by simply bringing gold.\n\n4. You need Champion of Stormwind for this vendor. If your first championship was another city, accept Stormwind's Valiant line and repeat its 25-seal training and challenge. Only one new city can be in training at a time; home-city Exalted reputation and tournament championship are different requirements.\n\n5. Complete Crusader Rhydalla's Black Knight investigation through The Black Knight's Fall to unlock Threat From Above. This adds a Champion daily; do not confuse the quest-chain Black Knight with buying the mount directly.\n\n6. Earn and save 100 Champion's Seals through the unlocked Champion dailies. Prefer the Champion's Purse reward when offered for another possible seal, and open the purses. Keep doing city training alongside the Champion dailies if also working toward Crusader.\n\n7. For additional daily seals, set Trial of the Champion to Heroic and enter the five-player portal at the Coliseum (75.1, 21.8). Complete the mounted opening and all bosses, looting them. This is not the adjacent Trial of the Crusader raid;